@startuml
!include ../../../tools/diagrams/cka-theme.puml
left to right direction
title kubectl edit changes the live object, not your file

rectangle "Local file nginx.yaml\n<size:11>image: nginx</size>" <<plain>> as file
rectangle "Live object in the cluster\n<size:11>image: nginx:1.18</size>\n<size:11>after kubectl edit</size>" <<accent>> as live
rectangle "Later: kubectl apply -f nginx.yaml\n<size:11>the file sets image, so it goes back to nginx</size>" <<bad>> as lost
rectangle "Better: edit the file, then apply\n<size:11>the file stays the record of what is running</size>" <<good>> as better

file --> live : created from
live --> lost : next apply
file --> better
@enduml
